# HOME: a bead for each loop layer on the satellite's orbit, at its place in the field (left, right), in its
# sound's colour, lit while it sounds. (A look: home_beads.png.)
wait 1000
tap REC
key w2 down
wait 2600
tap REC
wait 100
key w2 up
tapkey b8
tap REC
key w5 down
wait 2500
key w5 up
wait 300
tap REC
wait 100
tapkey b9
tap REC
key w4 down
wait 2500
key w4 up
wait 300
tap REC
wait 100
expect layers 3
tap SEL
tap ENV
turn K1 -30
turn SELECT 1
turn K1 30
tap HOME
wait 1200
shot home_beads.png
expect clips 0
